## **2\. Routing & Server Rules**

### **2.1 Astro Build Configuration**

// astro.config.mjs  
export default defineConfig({  
  site: 'https://atelierlogicgroup.com',  
  trailingSlash: 'always',  
  output: 'static',  
  build: { format: 'directory' },  
});

* Corporate Hub: https://atelierlogicgroup.com/ (Static Astro build)  
* Product Hub: https://relulayer.ai/ (Static product site)  
* Domain Redirect: https://relulayer.com/\* → 301 Moved Permanently → https://relulayer.ai/  
* **Legacy Route Purging:** Nginx returns 410 Gone for ^/(wp-content|wp-json|wp-includes|wp-admin|feed) to clear legacy WordPress URLs from Google Search Console.  
* Routes are emitted as dist/\<route\>/index.html.  
* **Static hosts will 404 any URL without a trailing slash.**

### **2.2 Same-Domain Links (must use trailing slashes)**

* ✅ /compliance/  
* ✅ /privacy/  
* ✅ /terms/  
* ✅ /relulayer/  
* ✅ /cisa-memory-safety-audit/  
* ✅ /autonomous-flight-safety-governor/  
